   "note": "estimated - no straight-on top view exists. Positions are fractions of the top face in the back render (image 3, raised about 35 degrees), corrected with the parts' own sizes: the five-way power header (Phoenix MSTB-GF family, 35.56 mm) runs front to back with its pole legend '1 + - earth + - 2' on one side and POWER:12-55V DC on the other (read off this build's back render), pole 1 at the rear; the RELAY header and the ground screw with its earth symbol are near the front edge. The video (1:00-1:02) confirms every part and legend close up but not their places on the face. Good to a few millimetres."
